==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Chinchou|51}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion; both cards have the Lightning Ball attack.
*'''Lightning Ball''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Lanturn|20}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

